    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swimsuit Summer Slam, commonly known as SSS, has been held by the super entertainment company in collaboration with adult video companies for several years. In response to the global trend of declining birth rates, entertainment, and adultification, the competition aims to select male amateurs to challenge the long-standing female athletes in water sports and engage in dramatic physical confrontations to select the strongest and most elite sperm for human reproduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game modes:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can choose one of the three opponents to battle against. After winning the battle, you can unlock a practice mode for continuous battles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A victory in battle can earn you cash, which can be used to purchase upgrades for various skills and attributes at the Talent menu, making the battle much easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player takes on the role of the male protagonist and challenges three of the strongest female characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the battle, players can control left and right movement by pressing A and D keys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The opponent will move and prepare for an attack, and there will be a countdown readiness period before the attack. During this readiness period, if the correct judgment can be made, it is possible to dodge the opponent's attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dodging enough attacks, you can counterattack and defeat your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you successfully dodge your opponents in a row, there will be a combo counter, and the combo can allow the player to earn more cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating the strongest female character will unlock her corresponding story, which includes her exclusive animations and plot in the story mode.</p>",
